::: {.callout-note}
## Assumptions in the rescaling

1000 Genomes European samples include a Finnish group (FIN), while gnomAD NFE excludes Finnish individuals.
Rescaling assumes the linkage structure carries over and moves only the allele frequencies. Haplotypes seen
on a handful of chromosomes are poorly estimated, and the table gives each standard error.
:::

